  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information : </strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://socialwelfareup.upsdc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Social Welfare Department, SWD Uttar Pradesh</a>,</span> <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">has released the Notification for the </span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admission 2026 on the official website of the SWD</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">. Applications for the</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Online Form 2026 has Started from 18 May 2026, Candidate can apply until 18 June 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admission 2026 given below.</span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Social Welfare Department, SWD Uttar Pradesh</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admission 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>18 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>18 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date Complete Form : <b>18 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <b>05 July 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available : <b>25 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result Declared : <b>28 July 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Free Coaching Start : <b>August 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">No Application Fee for the Online Registration Only Fill the Online Application Form.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">IAS Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UPPSC Pre Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Center Details</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Total Seats</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chhatrapati Shahu Ji Maharaj Shodh Avam Prasikshan Sansthan Bhagidari Bhawan, Lucknow</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">250</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Adarsh Purva Prashikshan Kendra Aliganj, Lucknow (Only for Female)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">150</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">IAS / PSC Coaching Center, Hapur Ghaziabad</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">150</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sant Ravisas IAS / PSC Coaching Center Varanasi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">75</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Dr B.R. Ambedkar Coaching, Agra</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">N/A</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Dr. B.R. Ambedkar Coaching, Aligarh</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">150</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Prayagraj Center</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">40</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 69.8358%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Gorakhpur Center</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.1642%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">75</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates&nbsp; belonging to OBC /SC/ST Category, Having Uttar Pradesh Domicile /hailing from Uttar Pradesh are eligible ,Bachelor degree holders&nbsp; in Any Stream &amp; Whose Annual Income is Less than 6 Lakh Per Annum are eligible for filling up this Free Coaching Online Application form</span></li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Important </strong>– Applicants make sure that they are not previously enrolled in such kind of Coaching Institutes &amp; they are not engaged in any kind of Institute.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching 2026 : Requisites of Online Application&nbsp; Form (Scanned)</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10th High School Certificate Scan Copy.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Graduation Degree Certificate Scan Copy</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Photo ID Proof (Aadhar / Pan / DL / Etc) Scan Copy</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Recently Passport Size Photo and Signature</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Any Other Supporting Documents</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admissions Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be based on Written / Online Exam.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Apply : SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admission 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://socialwelfareup.upsdc.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the SWD before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other&nbsp;&nbsp;Notification Here –&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for SWD UP IAS / PCS Free Coaching Admission 2026 can read all the information related to the Admission is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-bloc